									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>RETROPULSE Wave</strong> is a relaxing <strong>neon connect-the-dots puzzle game</strong> that combines colorful line-drawing challenges, vibrant retro-anime illustrations, and atmospheric <strong>RETROWAVE aesthetics</strong> inspired by the 1980s.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Connect matching colored dots, draw glowing neon paths, and fill the puzzle grid to reveal hidden artwork. Complete <strong>50 unique levels</strong>, challenge your logic and spatial thinking, and enjoy a nostalgic world of tropical sunsets, ocean waves, and electronic music.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Connect the Dots. Reveal the Art.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Solve colorful <strong>line-drawing puzzles</strong> by connecting dots of the same color with bright neon lines.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Carefully plan your routes, find the right connections, and fill the grid to complete each level. Simple mechanics make the gameplay easy to understand, while different dot arrangements challenge your observation, concentration, and logical thinking.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Complete each puzzle to uncover a vibrant <strong>retro-anime illustration</strong> hidden behind the glowing grid.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5295530/extras/f90596ed9220564525bd343db71f25c4.poster.avif?t=1793969980" width=1170 height=670 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5295530/extras/f90596ed9220564525bd343db71f25c4.webm?t=1793969980" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5295530/extras/f90596ed9220564525bd343db71f25c4.mp4?t=1793969980" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Immerse Yourself in RETROWAVE Aesthetics</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Explore a colorful world inspired by <strong>1980s neon aesthetics, retro anime, and retro-futuristic landscapes</strong>.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Discover tropical sunsets, ocean waves, palm trees, glowing horizons, and vibrant illustrations that capture the nostalgic atmosphere of an endless summer.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Combined with atmospheric electronic music, the colorful visuals create a relaxing experience for fans of <strong>retro-inspired puzzle games</strong> and neon artwork.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >50 Levels of Colorful Logic Puzzles</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Progress through <strong>50 unique levels</strong> featuring different combinations of colored dots and increasingly engaging pathfinding challenges.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Connect matching colors, think ahead, and discover the correct routes to fill each puzzle grid.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Use hints when you need help, unlock beautiful retro-anime illustrations, and revisit your completed artwork in the gallery.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Key Features</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>50 unique levels</strong> – Complete colorful neon connect-the-dots puzzles.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Color-matching gameplay</strong> – Connect dots of the same color using glowing lines.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Line-drawing puzzles</strong> – Plan your routes and fill the grid to solve each challenge.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Hidden picture reveals</strong> – Unlock vibrant retro-anime illustrations by completing puzzles.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>RETROWAVE aesthetics</strong> – Enjoy neon colors, tropical sunsets, and nostalgic 1980s-inspired artwork.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Retro-anime illustrations</strong> – Discover colorful pictures hidden behind each puzzle.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Helpful hints</strong> – Get assistance with challenging levels.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Picture gallery</strong> – Revisit your unlocked illustrations.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Atmospheric electronic music</strong> – Enjoy a relaxing soundtrack with nostalgic electronic vibes.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong> – Earn achievements as you progress.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Steam Cloud support</strong> – Synchronize supported game progress.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Controller support</strong> – Enjoy the puzzles using a supported controller.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Single-player gameplay</strong> – Solve puzzles and unlock artwork at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Connect the colors, illuminate the grid, and reveal the hidden beauty of all 50 levels in RETROPULSE Wave!</strong></p>						</div>
					</div>
